{"id":"e70d366e-79cb-47fd-8689-d1288b4c73a9","title":"BMW Dallas Marathon 2026","date":"2026-12-13","time":"7:00 AM","end_date":null,"venue_name":"Dallas City Hall","city":"Dallas","state":"TX","category":"Sports","description":"Dallas's premier marathon weekend with full marathon, half, ultra, 5K, and relay options. Benefits Scottish Rite for Children.","image_url":null,"ticket_url":"https://www.bmwdallasmarathon.com/","source":"web","source_id":"web-bmw-dallas-marathon-2026-20261213","price_range":"$89-$189","organizer":"BMW Dallas Marathon","audience":"All runners","created_at":"2026-05-18T18:28:37.638215+00:00","updated_at":"2026-05-18T18:28:37.638215+00:00","long_description":"The BMW Dallas Marathon has been a Texas running tradition for over 40 years. The race weekend features a full marathon, half marathon, ultra marathon, 5-person relay, 10K, and 5K — something for every runner. The course starts at Dallas City Hall, loops through scenic White Rock Lake, and finishes back downtown. Since 1997, the marathon has donated nearly $5 million to Scottish Rite for Children. The December timing provides cool running weather, and the event has sold out three consecutive years.","artist_info":null,"venue_info":"Start/finish at Dallas City Hall, 1500 Marilla St. The course is flat and fast, passing through downtown Dallas and around White Rock Lake (120m total elevation gain). DART light rail serves the City Hall area. Post-race party with food, beer, and live music.","slug":"bmw-dallas-marathon-2026-20261213","latitude":32.7767,"longitude":-96.797,"is_featured":false,"venue_images":["https://maps.googleapis.com/maps/api/place/photo?maxwidth=800&photo_reference=Ab43m-viHaZiBT41dPrJbGWfqTRMp6OhK3XUHMqbhKEVveCpe-THX-W5OvFRV5-1VS0IV0ISFfe3pn9O6551hNsXyWA50EmWm1L0jNSLV2WIgLCrZbOlo9M_3APYHxLg5a9_wX3diGsjxCA_aXBWCutElDERvSJCSM9Kk6rqQrgqajT3nw-TfxthF4iiyqK0V7lclUzSJjeL2BaZvyaI-1BkywQ3lBqolFdp9XZgKBCzk57uBtJOcUbcFAAMQS2Z-uSMej9GhRuvIDcXKUytLVBlFFXE9fytAT-fFcUvY5lbeqlnOb48scu6y